TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh be.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}çok rahatladım! Böyle şeyler
seçme konusunda pek iyi değilim. Kokusu
hoş ve tatlıydı, sanki {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0200}}
gibi. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Neyse, beğenmene sevindim.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Well, of course I did. It was such a
pretty color. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}But it seems like I
saw a flower like that somewhere.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Por supuesto. ¡Además, el color
es divino! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Aunque tengo la extraña
sensación de haberla visto antes.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ho apprezzato molto il pensiero.
E che bel colore! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ho l'impressione
di aver già visto un fiore simile.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Aber nicht doch! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ihr anmutiges
Äußeres macht das wieder wett.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich habe den Eindruck, ich hätte sie
irgendwo schon einmal gesehen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Elbette beğendim. Rengi çok güzeldi.
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ama sanki o çiçeği bir yerlerde
daha önce görmüş gibiyim{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0011:}}¡No! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¿La cogiste de su jardín?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Sin pedirle permiso?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Eso está mal y lo sabes, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gracias por el regalo, pero no
vuelvas a hacerlo.

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}I don't mean to brag, but I'm
trying to broaden my interests,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Yo no soy muy de presumir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
pero sí que me gusta ampliar
horizontes y tal,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Non per vantarmi, ma sto
cercando di crearmi nuovi
interessi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Das muss eine Verwechslung sein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
Hast du mich gesehen, wie ich eine
Glühbirne wechseln wollte?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}You might like to read a novel
that I'm just finishing up.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
The Infinite {{TAG:000E:0004:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's not for everyone, but a smarty
like you will gobble that book
right up, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Je viens de terminer un livre génial :{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}}
contre-attaque.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je ne le recommanderais pas à
n'importe qui, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}mais à toi, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}je pense
qu'il te plaira, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Potresti venire a un corso
di cucina insieme a me.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}L'esame finale è preparare
un piatto di {{TAG:0005:0013:0200}}
da leccarsi i baffi!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Cucinare insieme è divertente.
Pensaci su, va bene?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Du könntest mit mir einen
Musikkurs besuchen.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Das Motto lautet diesmal:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
„{{TAG:0005:0014:0200}} für Anfänger“.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Du würdest sicher die Ohren der
Anwesenden entzücken.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Überlege
es dir also bitte ernsthaft.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Please, it was nothing. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I was only
talking about a trip I took.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}It was to a town where the
{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}} was invented.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I was just curious, that's all.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bah, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ce n'est qu'une histoire parmi
tant d'autres...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Je parlais de la fois où je suis allé
dans la ville où a été inventé{{TAG:000E:0008:02CD0000020065000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ma no, non era niente di speciale.
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Stavo parlando di un viaggio.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sono stato nella città in cui hanno
inventato {{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci sono andato per pura curiosità.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}Ja,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} im Nachhinein kann man schön
beim Kaffee darüber plaudern.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber
damals war es die reinste Qual!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich habe gerade von einer Reise
in die Stadt erzählt, wo {{TAG:000E:0008:02CD060064006500720006006400690065000600640061007300}}
{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}} erfunden wurde.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aman, ne yaptım ki. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Sadece çıktığım
bir yolculuktan söz ediyordum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0200}}'ın
icat edildiği bir kasabaya gitmiştim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sadece merak etmiştim, hepsi bu.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I can tell that you love to take trips,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}You just have that
cool look about you, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gezmeyi sevdiğin belli oluyor,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Üzerinde tam o havalı gezgin
havası var, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I had no idea! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Well, all three of us
have travel in common then!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
How lovely, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non lo sapevo affatto! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Beh, allora
noi tre abbiamo qualcosa in comune:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
ci piace viaggiare, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hiç bilmiyordum! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Demek üçünüzün de ortak
noktası seyahat etmekmiş!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ne hoş, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ya sabes lo que dicen:{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
"Cada viaje es una aventura".{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¿Acaso no es cierto?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Interessant, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}pah! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Wenn man auf ge-
klaute Koffer, durchwachte Nächte
und Kakerlaken steht, vielleicht!
Da sollte man nichts verklären,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Biliyorsun, seyahat dolu bir hayat
macera dolu bir hayattır! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Sence
de öyle değil mi?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hombre, por supuesto. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Que no te quepa ninguna duda,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Dann solltest du auch bald einmal
in die Ferne aufbrechen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je weiter
weg, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}desto besser! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}BWA HA HA HA!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Belki seyahat etmek senin de hoşuna
gider?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Yan kasabaya gitmek bile
olsa{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}biraz uzaklaşmak güzeldir.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Spoken like a true world traveler!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}you've inspired me to think
about where I'll go next!
